        "description": "ByteHook (also known as bhook) is a PLT hook framework for Android apps open-sourced by ByteDance. It provides a comprehensive solution for using PLT hooks in Android apps, not just address replacement. Most of ByteDance's Android apps (including TikTok, Toutiao, Xigua Video) use ByteHook as the PLT hook solution in the online environment.",
